      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a great start. i really want to lean into the idea that the economic stuff was just noise or background chaos, and that the real direction of the revolution was purely his design. can you expand on that? maybe write a paragraph where he's basically acting as the architect of the new republic, making these high-level intellectual choices that the \"masses\" were just following blindly?",
